     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
           "text": "@Andrew Woods"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ", okay I pulled my master branches and re-built",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "fcrepo4",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         },
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "fcrepo-module-auth-webac",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         },
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "fcrepo-webapp-plus (using -P webac)",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         }
        ],
        "type": "bulletList"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I started the webapp using [[mvn jetty:run -P webac]]",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I browsed to ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " and logged in with admin1:password3",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I then started a transaction via the web-ui and created a container with and without an identifier. Both worked and I then was able to commit the transaction. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I feel like maybe I am missing something obvious.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
