       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Jared Whiklo",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" data-account-id=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" accountid=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Andrew Woods</a>, okay I pulled my master branches and re-built</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>fcrepo4</li>\n\t<li>fcrepo-module-auth-webac</li>\n\t<li>fcrepo-webapp-plus (using -P webac)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>I started the webapp using [<span class=\"error\">&#91;mvn jetty:run -P webac&#93;</span>]</p>\n\n<p>I browsed to <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest</a> and logged in with admin1:password3</p>\n\n<p>I then started a transaction via the web-ui and created a container with and without an identifier. Both worked and I then was able to commit the transaction. </p>\n\n<p>I feel like maybe I am missing something obvious.</p>",
